    ('360da20f-8f95-4ba9-83fc-49d4b193b679'::uuid, 'period_name', '500 BC - 1 AD', '< 4500 BC', 'fields-wd5-2026-10-25p-s003:360da20f-8f95-4ba9-83fc-49d4b193b679:period_name', 'fields-wd5-2026-10-25p-s003 (wd5-derive-period-name): period_start -23050 (written in this step)', '[{"source": "pipeline/utils/text.py:categorize_period", "url": "pipeline/utils/text.py", "quote": "categorize_period(-23050) = ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "output/remediation/gold_standard/GOLD_STANDARD.md:79", "url": "output/remediation/gold_standard/GOLD_STANDARD.md", "quote": "| `period_name` | equals `categorize_period(period_start)` |"}, {"source": "WD5 decision (counted, round 0, field_researcher:wd5-r0-b0084)", "decision": "replace", "status": "MISSING", "reasoning": "The 2016 excavation of the larger cave found flaked stone artefacts, i.e. human presence, dating to 25,000 years ago (the deposits themselves go back 65,000 years, but artefacts mark the occupation); 1950 minus 25,000 is -23050, far older than the stored bucket 500 BC - 1 AD. The luminescence study of Schaarschmidt et al. (Quaternary Geochronology 2018) puts occupation of Badahlin (Padah-Lin) at about 30 ka, same band (< 4500 BC); the 1969-72 rock-shelter dates (1,750-13,000 BP) are younger, so the cave''s start is the Pleistocene date.", "value_page": null, "model": "anthropic/claude-sonnet-5-5 (Claude Code agent)", "adversarial": {"answered_by": "adversarial:adv-r1-b0006", "model": "anthropic/claude-sonnet-5-5 (Claude Code agent)", "reason": "Wikipedia gives artefacts at 25,000 years ago (and deposits at 65,000) without a primary source, while the peer-reviewed luminescence paper (Schaarschmidt et al. 2018, Quaternary Geochronology 49) dates human occupation of Badahlin to about 30 ka and Gu Myaung to about 25 ka; the Pleistocene band is certain but the year -23050 is not securely the start of this cave.", "round": 1, "verdict": "unclear"}, "owner": {"at": "2026-10-25T07:49:50+00:00", "decision": "D69", "reason": "owner 2026-10-25 (D69): write the researcher''s value with its found quote for a cell the re-check held as unclear"}}]'::jsonb),
