 a cell the re-check held as unclear"}}]'::jsonb),
    ('36408f22-774c-4626-a92f-e0c231f69206'::uuid, 'period_name', '1 - 500 AD', '500 - 1000 AD', 'fields-wd5-2026-10-25p-s003:36408f22-774c-4626-a92f-e0c231f69206:period_name', 'fields-wd5-2026-10-25p-s003 (wd5-derive-period-name): period_start 600 (written in this step)', '[{"source": "pipeline/utils/text.py:categorize_period", "url": "pipeline/utils/text.py", "quote": "categorize_period(600) = ''500 - 1000 AD''"}, {"source": "output/remediation/gold_standard/GOLD_STANDARD.md:79", "url": "output/remediation/gold_standard/GOLD_STANDARD.md", "quote": "| `period_name` | equals `categorize_period(period_start)` |"}, {"source": "WD5 decision (counted, round 0, field_researcher:wd5-r0-b0097)", "decision": "replace", "status": "MISSING", "reasoning": "The English article (citing the paleohydrologist Kenneth Wright that the original structure is of Wari type) and a tourism page both say the Rumicolca gate/aqueduct at Lucre was first built by the Wari and later refashioned by the Inca; the older ''gate theory'' also puts Wari foundations under the Inca veneer. The first construction is therefore Wari, so the named period ''wari'' is the value; no scholarly source was found that dates it more exactly, and the Inca phase is later. The rule-made stored start of 43 (Roman epoch from a gate type) has no source.", "value_page": null, "model": "anthropic/claude-sonnet-5-5 (Claude Code agent)", "adversarial": {"answered_by": "adversarial:adv-r1-b0006", "model": "anthropic/claude-sonnet-5-5 (Claude Code agent)", "reason": "That the first structure at Rumicolca is Wari rests on the English and Spanish Wikipedia (the latter says only ''probablemente'' Tiahuanaco-Huari) and a tour-operator page; I found no excavation report or dated scholarly source for it, and neither text gives a year, so the period word ''wari'' (600) is a weakly supported start for this gate, not a settled one.", "round": 1, "verdict": "unclear"}, "owner": {"at": "2026-10-25T07:49:50+00:00", "decision": "D69", "reason": "owner 2026-10-25 (D69): write the researcher''s value with its found quote for a cell the re-check held as unclear"}}]'::jsonb),
